$P紫電$Z向$N轟下﹐$N被這兩股絕世力量轟中﹐登時被殛的灰飛煙滅。~
Chance          10
Value           20
Parry           0
Situs           ATTACK_RANDOM
Innate          0 0
End
#Damage
Description
